	(text "Host side: CH446Q crosspoint mirrors the physical matrix onto the C128 ROW/COL lines.  X = host columns, Y = host rows,\nin the order that routes cleanly from J2 (XP_X_OF_COL / XP_Y_OF_ROW in gen_sch.py); the firmware addresses through the same table.\nSerial address mode (P/S low): DAT, CS/CK, STB, RST straight from the ESP32 (VIH is 2.0 V at a 5 V supply).\nLock lines are open-drain FETs; 40/80 asserts at power-on when JP1 is closed, before the MCU boots.\nRESTORE is hard-wired to the host; D3 lets the MCU see it, Q3 lets the MCU press it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "01965e2f-fdb8-574f-b6c7-a74fac7c50a7")
	)
